      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey i need help writing an email to my boss. im the head of dev for this new fintech app and the project scope is just getting way too big. things are being added every single day and my team is burning out. i need to ask for either more people or a later deadline without sounding like i cant handle it. can u help me draft something professional?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
