      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks this is a good start. but i think it might be a bit too formal? my boss is pretty chill so it doesn't need to be super stiff. can u make it sound a bit more like a direct conversation between colleagues? also can u add a line specifically about how these constant new feature requests are \"sneaking in\" and making the original plan impossible to stick to? i want to highlight that it's not just a lack of effort, it's the unexpected growth of the project itself.",
